This PR adds an identical `resolveCustomParams(params)` to both `checkWipLabel.js` and `recoverDirtyReviewTestCase.js` — the same one-liner already exists in 12+ files (`cacheToReleases.js`, `mergeStoryTestAutomationPR.js`, `restoreFromReleases.js`, `timerAutoCommitAndSave.js`, …), so this follows the established (duplicated) pattern rather than introducing a new one. Since the whole point of this ticket is extraction of shared-shaped helpers, consider a future follow-up that moves this one-liner (and `wipLabelFor`-style helpers) into `js/common/` so the copy count stops growing. Not needed for this PR to merge.
